---
import { DEVNET } from '../../data/chain-home';
import PageviewBeacon from '../../components/PageviewBeacon.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#142c2a"/><meta name="description" content="Look up a PointCast devnet transaction and understand the node's receipt."/><title>Receipt desk · PointCast</title>
<style>
:root{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:#202d29;background:#f5f2e9}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}main{max-width:920px;margin:auto;padding:24px clamp(18px,5vw,48px) 64px}a{color:#175e54}nav{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.85rem}h1{font:400 clamp(2.6rem,7vw,5rem)/1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:22px 0}.eyebrow{margin-top:60px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:700;font-size:.75rem;color:#60766a}.lead{max-width:670px;line-height:1.6;color:#53655b}.notice{border-left:3px solid #bd7649;padding:12px 16px;background:#eae6d9;line-height:1.5;font-size:.9rem}.panel{border:1px solid #d6d2c6;border-radius:8px;background:#fffefa;padding:clamp(16px,4vw,30px);margin-top:28px}.label{display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:8px}input,button{font:inherit}input{display:block;width:100%;min-height:48px;border:1px solid #a5b0a2;border-radius:4px;padding:10px 12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}button{min-height:48px;border:1px solid #183e37;border-radius:4px;padding:10px 18px;background:#183e37;color:#fff;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;margin-top:12px}button:disabled{opacity:.65;cursor:wait}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #c47849;outline-offset:3px}.hint{font-size:.82rem;color:#637469;line-height:1.5}.status{margin-top:24px;line-height:1.55}.result{border-top:1px solid #ddd8cb;margin-top:20px;padding-top:20px}.result h2{font:400 1.8rem Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 8px}.result dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(110px,160px) 1fr;gap:10px;margin:20px 0}.result dt{color:#68786b}.result dd{margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.result code{font-size:.85rem}.footer{margin-top:28px;color:#637469;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.55}@media(max-width:520px){.eyebrow{margin-top:40px}.result dl{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:5px}.result dd{margin-bottom:12px}button{width:100%}}
</style></head>
<body><main><nav><a href="/chain/">← PointCast Chain</a><a href="/chain/start/">Wallet &amp; signing</a><a href="/chain/verify-a-block/">Verify a block</a></nav><p class="eyebrow">PointCast · devnet utility</p><h1>Receipt desk.</h1><p class="lead">Paste a transaction hash to see whether the PointCast node has received, included, or rejected it. Use this after a transaction, or share the result with someone checking the same hash.</p><p class="notice"><strong>Play network.</strong> This is a single-server devnet; it can reset and its ATTN has no promised value. A node's response is an observation, not an independent proof or a finality guarantee.</p>
<section class="panel" data-receipt-desk data-api={DEVNET.url} data-genesis={DEVNET.genesis}><form data-form><label class="label" for="hash">Transaction hash</label><input id="hash" name="hash" placeholder="64 hexadecimal characters" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" maxlength="64" required/><p class="hint">Find the hash on the receipt shown after you submit a transaction. Never paste a private key or recovery phrase.</p><button data-submit>Check transaction</button></form><div class="status" data-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div data-result></div><noscript><p>JavaScript is needed to look up a transaction.</p></noscript></section><p class="footer">To independently examine an included block, open <a href="/chain/verify-a-block/">Verify a block</a> and enter the height shown here. This desk does not sign or submit transactions.</p></main><script is:inline type="module" src="/chain/receipt/desk.js"></script><PageviewBeacon /></body></html>
